                "title": "Contemporary Solid Brass Square Deadbolt, Fusion S7",
                "description": "Fusion Brass-S7, Contemporary Square Deadbolt - The Contemporary Square deadbolt is made out of solid brass. Choose from brushed nickel, antique pewter, polished chrome, matte black, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. It can adjust to fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick. For doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backesets.\r\n",
